WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Good morning, John.

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.960
Good news for self-employed people

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:05.280
with chronic pre-existing conditions, like myself.

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:08.580
Soon, insurance companies will not be able to be biased against you

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:12.540
for having even the bizzarest of pre-existing conditions.

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:13.740
Today I wanted to bring you

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:19.020
the top 10 weirdest diseases that I could find on the Internet!

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:20.900
In no particular order, the first bizarre disease

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:22.920
that I want to talk about today is

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:25.420
complications due to lightning strike.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:27.720
Those who have been stuck often have problems with their memory,

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:28.800
with their equilibrium,

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:29.780
with motor control,

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:34.480
and, oddly enough, are much, much, more likely to commit suicide than the average person.

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:37.540
However, this is, by far, the most peculiar bit.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.540
One of the complications of being struck by lightning

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.320
is that you are much more likely to be struck by lightning...

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:44.420
AGAIN.

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:46.180
So yeah, if, for example, the place

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:48.820
that lightning does not strike twice is Roy Sullivan,

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:53.580
that is inaccurate, because Roy Sullivan was struck by lightning 7 times.

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:55.880
Bizarre disease number two is PICA.

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:59.760
A disease common in children, but also, oddly enough, common in pregnant women,

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:01.700
in which people want to eat things

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:02.700
that are not food.

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:05.360
You got nails, dirt, coal, sand,

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:09.400
pounds and pounds of human hair stolen from beauty salons...

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:12.320
Bizarre disease number three: Nintendonitis.

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:14.000
Nintendonitis is exactly what it sounds like --

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:17.940
it's any repetitive stress injury caused by video gaming.

00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:20.180
Relatedly, jogger's nipple --

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:23.300
it's a common disease in joggers, in which their tight shirts rub against their nipples

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:25.660
and then they create "nipple fishers".

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:26.540
Aaghhh!

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:27.540
Jogger's nipple!

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:30.720
Just one more reason why I love to sit.

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:33.960
Bizarre disease number four: odd skin coloration.

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:38.100
Some people are black, some people are white, some people are all the way in between,

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:40.900
but some people are blue, or red!

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:45.120
For example, if there's a lot of silver in your diet, say that you live in a place where there's tons of

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:50.380
silver in the water, or you have silver-related pica, your skin will turn blue!

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:53.480
Disease number five, toxoplasma is a parasite that lives in cat poop.

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:56.620
The really strange thing is, here, that women with toxoplasmosis

00:01:56.620 --> 00:01:59.860
are statistically happier than women who do not have it,

00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:02.680
while men have more negative side effects to toxoplasmosis.

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:06.960
And thus, it has been posited that toxoplasmosis is the reason why

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:10.980
there are so many crazy, old cat ladies, and not so many crazy, old cat men.

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:14.614
Next bizarre disease: insensitivity to pain might sound like a pretty good thing.

00:02:14.620 --> 00:02:16.880
You're certainly not going to lose any fist fights.

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:21.820
But people who suffer from "congenital analgesia" generally have very short life spans,

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:25.719
because they don't know when they're being injured or when they're uncomfortable.

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:29.380
Children with this disease sometimes bite through their lips or tongue,

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:32.420
and often cause severe damage to their eyes without even knowing it.

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:35.740
Nutmeg psychosis is psychosis caused by nutmeg.

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:38.040
Nutmeg, taken in significant enough quantities,

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:42.260
can cause paranoia, hallucinations, feelings of impending doom!

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:46.560
Now, we've all got body odor, there's no need to deny it and tell me that your armpits smell like flowers,

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:50.720
but you probably don't have body odor like the people who suffer from trimethylaminuria.

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:53.672
Some people don't have the enzyme needed to break down trimethylamine.

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:57.640
And so, trimethylamine builds up in their bodies and you can smell it in their breath and their sweat and their pee.

00:02:57.640 --> 00:03:01.860
Unfortunately for them, trimethylamine smells kind of like rotting fish,

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:04.960
so that's what they smell like. Which is pretty horrible.

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:12.140
And finally, number ten, we have possibly the coolest name in all of medical disorder history, Ondine's curse.

00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:17.020
Ondine's curse, aside from being a really horrible curse, is fascinating!

00:03:17.020 --> 00:03:21.420
Becuase people who suffer from it literally die if they fall asleep!

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:24.380
You're either born with it, or it sets in after a serious trauma,

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:28.320
and it's more officially called "primary alveolar hypoventilation".

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:32.600
But the name of the disease comes from the myth of Ondine, who, in Greek mythology, is

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:37.400
a man who cheated on a water nymph, which, let me tell you, is something you never want to do.

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:43.120
The water nymph was so enraged that she cursed him to forget to breathe if he ever fell asleep.

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:49.360
John, the theme for this week is top ten lists, that was mine. I wanna hear if you guys have any bizarre diseases in the comments.

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:54.620
Tell me about the diseases that you have, and tell me how you're feeling about the new healthcare legislation.

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:56.737
I'm looking forward to seeing all of you in the comments.

00:03:56.737 --> 00:04:00.000
John, I will see you on Wednesday. Don't forget to be awesome.

